00:58:37.260 --> 00:58:37.580
Not yet.

00:58:38.440 --> 00:58:39.180
Can't we get married?

00:58:40.820 --> 00:58:43.280
Oh, darling, let's not wait.

00:58:43.720 --> 00:58:45.420
